      "source_words_sha256": "f8a6445ffae4e501898b1f4042df8ca5bb01d40cfbc0324b34140527fb62faaa",
      "english": "You're right, Mama.\nThat drunk made up the tale\nof a rare-orb stranger...\fWe've got a different\nkind of strange one here.",
