    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000ED5C",
      "source_words_sha256": "7f456bcf090a2e37f0a92c572c53c406fdabda827a488281ccf16b63fffbb453",
      "english": "Mmm... The red beans...\fThey're laughing\nwhile doing the\nIna Bauer...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000EDD4",
      "source_words_sha256": "127673cb5f7a0559a8d39cd7a5d08ec382cebef0b33a7eed48da7ac923a29745",
      "english": "I tried this place's\nnew dish...\fAn Uji Kintoki rice bowl,\nor something...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000EE4C",
      "source_words_sha256": "04fca2a0157d7572b14d45511743dad21275c9d89721d68e45b66e74fb1bb6ab",
      "english": "Got any Gin Tama...?\nNo, Dragon Tama?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000EE80",
      "source_words_sha256": "3974110070330422e8ac7fafb6a07086c2ebab7f6e2a5342ad6f442d414150aa",
      "english": "...Slump.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000EEE8",
      "source_words_sha256": "bfb9e73cefd0f05afdfced2770c3dab0ef2ea418a4a88e78d8352b2bca4ae6b8",
      "english": "Gin Tama battles\nare pretty deep...\fI used to win by\nbrute force, but tough\nguys wipe the floor with me.\fGuess there's a limit\nto muscle alone...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000EFAC",
      "source_words_sha256": "cefdb1b42448d26b259edbf685acf382d237ae287eee5d95636450ea2627d76b",
      "english": "Gin Tama battles...\fHow do I put it?\nWatch your opponent.\nFind their weak point.\fThen strategy.\nDefense, boosts, traps...\fAaargh! Damn it all!\nCome on, brain! WORK!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F0BC",
      "source_words_sha256": "9299692358e5db0a3b974e9e02b23f1bda596f23db80d9960c8463f404b4439b",
      "english": "A shady Amanto\ntrading Gin Tama...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F0F0",
      "source_words_sha256": "68fc7674d6e8a8a3fe0b10e462d135d38fad40796f12bdfaad898e11a4a1b110",
      "english": "I see...\nI'm heading there now.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F11C",
      "source_words_sha256": "424ffcf8f2cf5dde651ec4a70aba4d1f9cb3c4d747e8ba63dfb2b8bf974b182b",
      "english": "Oh, good timing.\nI was looking for you.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F198",
      "source_words_sha256": "a1e9fcacbbf371a14b1c682a16f99663c99d96b18ca8c350345b6155d597003a",
      "english": "Word travels fast, huh?\fThey broke up at noon,\nbut at this hour\nthe customers gather again.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F360",
      "source_words_sha256": "507499a6daa8d663486e087b12370080222e228983be373c07e2ad3d4b75bdf5",
      "english": "Doesn't bother us, boss!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F3CC",
      "source_words_sha256": "8a5914ae4537f4065cd960d548fc496b48e1d8054611abd42a680f0c4a52c881",
      "english": "Huh? This...\fDoes my hairline look\nless natural than usual?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F418",
      "source_words_sha256": "c9e366de1d76f51b2d223bbc3d49db28399f2973ca13543133784a84cd6d85df",
      "english": "Doesn't bother you?\nWasn't that a weird\nway to put it?\fYou'd normally say\nit doesn't show, right?\fWhat do you mean,\nit doesn't bother you?\nWhat does that mean?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F4D0",
      "source_words_sha256": "94549acde4846d921a824de47041000719c4edc1711c24ae11a63bed9acb2139",
      "english": "Is it just me,\nor am I losing\nsome authority here?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F508",
      "source_words_sha256": "7edfeadfe23626f338e75c4a66a031652af194029780f1ec31236989b87d99d4",
      "english": "That's the point!\nIt SHOULD bother you!\fYou're in Bulldog,\nKabukicho's toughest\nbiker gang, aren't you?!\fYou should care\nabout your boss!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F58C",
      "source_words_sha256": "2bbcee46f2840d6768963ba0197ea6011f59b1a254e75fbbb6bd19dced2222ac",
      "english": "...\fMaybe it's time\nto disband Bulldog...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F5D0",
      "source_words_sha256": "47f0c32d99ddb5c780cc56d36e33dbef83594d616dd8e7df7166a25c1af6a9dc",
      "english": "Us bikers feel right\nat home outside\na convenience store.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F60C",
      "source_words_sha256": "f187c32ca1cbdd00e6673799860203a72f01da003637a11079d7a3e8548da3fa",
      "english": "Oh, the flashy kid.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F62C",
      "source_words_sha256": "81046ecedd4e4916caff824b2dbbf125eabfe5e539261c5e7d734c40873cfd33",
      "english": "Forgotten, Kondo?\fYou know. The old man's\nprecious daughter, Kuriko...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F67C",
      "source_words_sha256": "860f15a511c555083182fa610499506d5fe039cabb126379a43790589aca3676",
      "english": "Let's leave it, Kondo.\nCome on, let's go.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F6B0",
      "source_words_sha256": "41a6f6c2f93ce1f9b2a34e3a10d779b4125045162a3285a7693d9aa754e1982e",
      "english": "Sougo!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F6C0",
      "source_words_sha256": "8e1b9041ac21878c38a3e5a602850a5653b054113df12e0f4ad20325bc866507",
      "english": "Huh? Flashy kid?\nWho's this guy?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F6E8",
      "source_words_sha256": "1d0ecabcb2e4c16dc3dd0493094378a096e7dbab74799b6da862a117897aa3ec",
      "english": "Huh? You two split up?\nGood! The old man\ncan relax now.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F734",
      "source_words_sha256": "225051103b1e5db8711b493f983243bf495ec803fa423a31b66bb283dad43df3",
      "english": "So, who's that guy?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F74C",
      "source_words_sha256": "494212403bf9bab952c3189cb47265791ba380b6fd54de43685a8f757f6df6da",
      "english": "Her ex.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F758",
      "source_words_sha256": "0d833d77716240bb5ebbfd0b5b27b21efbe473310b51a13a9250ef57c7b223d9",
      "english": "Mayora 13...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F76C",
      "source_words_sha256": "252023b298bc7dc5da500291295c446c0c4b6f6a5deb6e0406cebd76e0f86287",
      "english": "...Sigh.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F780",
      "source_words_sha256": "7b7e4ba32ce7aaf361a03a71e1bca5a771001b72694debd1524e580f6b27baa2",
      "english": "Stop calling me her ex!\fDamn it... If he hadn't\nshown up, Kuriko and I...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F7D8",
      "source_words_sha256": "7e8acd9d43b086da08311d79039affdd9c88bade8672e60be7f4b9ae5b48f47b",
      "english": "That guy! You know...\nWhat was his name?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F80C",
      "source_words_sha256": "2b35fb028c26ba6ed3c59a1e498b2e7ee46e247f4a23dfe3b245e71311989302",
      "english": "Yeah! Mayora 13!\nThis is all his fault!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F88C",
      "source_words_sha256": "9e52d59b73284c98580b70741c805e6660ec7b9875552179251e3ffab953c3e6",
      "english": "...Mamushi Z?\nThere's a Gin Tama\nlike that too?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F900",
      "source_words_sha256": "a9a1b5847b8477f5318ee48b4e8ba6746d9452316d4d4361929cd80305c4590c",
      "english": "Again? Mom bought you some last birthday!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F984",
      "source_words_sha256": "13874df5156bf959e02c6caf4fc0c0bcea5daee840713bd8db7505de13a72ec4",
      "english": "No!\fI can't buy that!\nI've never even\nseen one myself!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000F9DC",
      "source_words_sha256": "c289ed177916f9b807cbf8536117d14e7e8ed2b4cb21c331bda8683de2e3d41c",
      "english": "Ugh... How do you even\nknow such a rare orb?\fAll right.\nI'll splurge this once.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000FA38",
      "source_words_sha256": "183b00ee7ef1e0c231dfb8db0a9b6b74b04742a401ccd20b810a8f70490b69ea",
      "english": "Next birthday, then.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000FA50",
      "source_words_sha256": "1142290ee78618f42a750184f4c887f62756c71c2ce1ee2923277042f276da7f",
      "english": "Hey, sis!\nBuy me some Gin Tama!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000FAA0",
      "source_words_sha256": "2ccb3f822d5d06d4effc425e1b4325bb15d5049468a52863133b12131c849c5e",
      "english": "Dragon!",
      "translator_note": "Dragon Tama abbreviated as D.T. to fit the original two-glyph slot; full term retained elsewhere."
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000FAB0",
      "source_words_sha256": "2f69d20350adb5a55b0105bfb4a33d3276576ce319b4b6e2c52d8ae33f841a3f",
      "english": "Tch...\fThen the combat orb,\nMamushi Z!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000FAE0",
      "source_words_sha256": "a11e95e5ec16b351a290b9d3b471351ef22a7a470e9a91e1f539f2b6ad0769b1",
      "english": "Yay! Love you, sis!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000FB08",
      "source_words_sha256": "9532bb96100cb0f6b15515768cc71bf0b982c138b8c7021126020a1ece89e77c",
      "english": "Can't wait! Mamushi Z...\nNext, a character orb.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000FB40",
      "source_words_sha256": "95fc6309161c1ad976b35a9d69056547eb353c048034c35de2dcf9564a3afd9a",
      "english": "With that, I could\nget Hijikata...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000FCC0",
      "source_words_sha256": "2173c7e66e0cbe41700d04aaf4a3e37deddda2a149644637d44be8dbc8301ecf",
      "english": "Well, this is unusual.\nWhat brings\nthe Shinsengumi here?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000FCFC",
      "source_words_sha256": "72c9190840e2269a50110c79dac1bf456cde13ef3a68744c39895bb3492f08a3",
      "english": "We buy unwanted things\nand sell them cheaply\nto people who need them.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000FD44",
      "source_words_sha256": "97b066027b95f7408b7c8a37ca819937bccf24145781584e5f0ac5af0af03a19",
      "english": "Sorry...\nWe don't deal\nin Gin Tama here.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000FD88",
      "source_words_sha256": "2c4976cdf20d7ae5f4607c16db834a6c3da720f434e15ae3b5a790074aac3b0f",
      "english": "You're Shinsengumi.\nYou know the trouble\nthose things bring.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000FE2C",
      "source_words_sha256": "4bc5275500cc7b3c754610558b3ef7f12b2fa35c313266803c951a924c1c7da8",
      "english": "Right.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000FE38",
      "source_words_sha256": "67c17f62ad4aaa0def9df5ec04d171c983480ede573c541af1f467e1171cf9c6",
      "english": "Sorry.\fNo useful tips yet.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000FE70",
      "source_words_sha256": "6f6687cd63b3e8913691de578aa817ef4ff2805e155822a4439eeb99c1a9f35c",
      "english": "Gin Tama?!\nAny Dragon Tama?!\nPlease say yes!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000FEB8",
      "source_words_sha256": "cbe7712f0c110ed85c5f14ff5e12adfc48a2bce2105b5fc59c0ef1e1e3b2b020",
      "english": "Please stock them...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000FF74",
      "source_words_sha256": "13fd2d0de57d529a69ae77bae77bf9a9bb9e493fa5a05910e524f21ee69acc76",
      "english": "Y-you're...\nThe new Earth Defense Force?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000FFA4",
      "source_words_sha256": "7d6e1068e727f98a5bad5d14959a8f970ddfc3d5804350bb924bc22fd628c8f9",
      "english": "A p-peon...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000FFBC",
      "source_words_sha256": "56d0ba3f79197ea4b95e06fa6c30c59cf7d1bdb68d6842015c6f555fac881a83",
      "english": "Yes... I'll behave...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0000FFE4",
      "source_words_sha256": "7d77b93099878eb83672eaa984391c3fdb416b584c6972cab33dfd264c8a110d",
      "english": "Give me a break!\nI haven't done\nanything wrong yet...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010020",
      "source_words_sha256": "43eaec4dece63429fd8178a6df0c13c6d8b8ff06008e07b80b22821bed312b2f",
      "english": "Huh? Gin Tama?\nUm... If these will do...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010060",
      "source_words_sha256": "4c2f7045a449ee3847541a87dd39fcc57104a3937922e4b71797fc55abd0d7d9",
      "english": "Damn you, EDF...",
      "translator_note": "Earth Defense Force shortened to EDF in this fixed slot; full name appears in the preceding exchange."
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010080",
      "source_words_sha256": "acec16499550d5826430fce3bb153393f8d19423d9c823c2193a60c429e0853d",
      "english": "What are you lot doing?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0001009C",
      "source_words_sha256": "9313d5fcefc6256e8d39eb4065e0a98555ac9ead52d11d34a9c654a74c571660",
      "english": "Depending on your answer,\nI'll haul you all in...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0001011C",
      "source_words_sha256": "3ae8d795c95dff2957b2cff61166b823cf1b9a2f8caaca1ff7b6a3c71f670547",
      "english": "Sougo... Forgot my\nprotractor. Mind if I\ngo home and get it?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0001015C",
      "source_words_sha256": "1f4a3c628e984374f7ecde45e78854e571e1b9222ed7fdf38b94e4ff264d8c18",
      "english": "No, huh...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0001016C",
      "source_words_sha256": "8c4e0d35a4604e58387f8701926f1b0bfccdbcc5b78d3f7a63b0eb0251ffc728",
      "english": "By the way,\ngot any Gin Tama?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010194",
      "source_words_sha256": "8ce9afa99322db8c102fd843213becfc5b4d38ba692454cc4ce326169f73b234",
      "english": "What, no Dragon Tama...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000101B8",
      "source_words_sha256": "1bf9962886b30f2d4ad45763a5b0fbfcf39eaf0c1a816b2e45f7f79e96c31730",
      "english": "Oh well. Cheer up, Toshi!\nWe've got more Gin Tama!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000101EC",
      "source_words_sha256": "c2997d47f0856d78b524b8d77ea04fc91564c91a447dbd0b82aca98d0d3deb09",
      "english": "No, Hijikata.\nDon't judge them\nby their looks...\fThese guys reek\nof small fry.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000102C8",
      "source_words_sha256": "93d4675526dcfb3c7a624c81a95f9b657405f9dd466e268390863aff8a2d69f6",
      "english": "Kondo, that's called\nshaking people down.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000102F8",
      "source_words_sha256": "92f410e9f88792190a139d55e398e2eb58f74dfeaaaef8e0d9836226f3e1f051",
      "english": "I've got two protractors.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010360",
      "source_words_sha256": "07ddf6132f501bcae106d48003ea060d2a5e7b21607cb4820a44e75f9fbab62b",
      "english": "Tooot!\fTofuuu!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0001037C",
      "source_words_sha256": "dc64c128a6ab17a793610d7b37cdd3ceeb87b2f6e823f747b66dccda790ef5a4",
      "english": "Hey, is there\na tofu seller in there?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000103B0",
      "source_words_sha256": "8a02ad983f51e6781f7bedb0ba924130bc7b53f63d0b74577b071da0ad856fd7",
      "english": "Don't, Sougo.\nA waste of ammo...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010494",
      "source_words_sha256": "6be4343421a9d66058f0c0890d19db4e2888be270b892149c47c04c2f179dad2",
      "english": "...Hijikata.\nMay I shoot?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000104D0",
      "source_words_sha256": "826905522b6e88ec51ff486717e2732971a2ec7c64df005581dd11b8635748bf",
      "english": "Your face changed\nat the sight of us.\nYou a Joui rebel...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010518",
      "source_words_sha256": "519f306feac8b2dcf53e0b3513ce9f2a0b750ee2a0b7bc5c22866a2bef87a632",
      "english": "Then what's at your hip?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010538",
      "source_words_sha256": "c2e258ced4cb6f26e715ec221df916324740a4c4870eaa0bf1d7bf9ea6a68cc3",
      "english": "Sogo",
      "translator_note": "Sogo is the short romanization of Sougo, used only for this two-glyph address slot."
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010540",
      "source_words_sha256": "a489bbfe86f29e8884a58b9895af3d73746bdd6a28060263beab154dcd13fffe",
      "english": "Right...\nWhat were you doing here?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000105A4",
      "source_words_sha256": "4f433f6a5dcbcbe7d949a046d179e33aca46a421c6e13697b690c382feaff80a",
      "english": "This again?!\nCan't you fight\nyour own battles...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000105E4",
      "source_words_sha256": "b0980ed06c134a3cd8e0a0063d84af17e04388d9d5a6775721af4537dfc4451d",
      "english": "Listen to me!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010600",
      "source_words_sha256": "b35254464495829bc70b3e1c06aec37cc826fa3e31bc59628b67d02cb022fc71",
      "english": "There! Happy now?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010624",
      "source_words_sha256": "d50b79cf350d1a5ecd769acea93d67c609f33606c2fc1a5b04b29a91401a7e0b",
      "english": "Could you be mistaken?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010640",
      "source_words_sha256": "98c6f7c580603ef60c588459485f9d4bdaa8f63d292eb4c52829bb9a2ffdd6d5",
      "english": "Right...\nSee anyone else suspicious?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010678",
      "source_words_sha256": "ce8046fd0bfc34ca89d6e80d34971703c6270e6d0fdd7630c10395e279f42f50",
      "english": "Got it...\nDon't lose to that guy.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000106AC",
      "source_words_sha256": "1aeac122e26232bea0f197e7661db560fe84a2beb3537af3ed67e59b371cce1e",
      "english": "Gin Tama?! You have some?\nAny Dragon Tama?\nGot any?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000106F4",
      "source_words_sha256": "35926bfad708b2f79df7dddc2c747f1cfd3c590c276f358dd68801e250e53238",
      "english": "You saw a Dragon Tama?!\nWhere, where, WHERE?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0001072C",
      "source_words_sha256": "68646f15bd74faf5b95e380f973be06b1dde5e9b766f297ac333863d589b44f9",
      "english": "You're on!\nGo get him, Toshi!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010780",
      "source_words_sha256": "4006532bfe1a7bdec1809a27ef5b0fc105bfacb6e809cdcfc0f7fc7e5e8a0b8a",
      "english": "Well?! Where did you\nsee the Dragon Tama?!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000107B4",
      "source_words_sha256": "72c98c1523191611ad3765a116eeb702ce1fb6cb1d2d5ef83b17e6334b2dfa2f",
      "english": "Here?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000107C0",
      "source_words_sha256": "8e21f2f1e5b6a81a56558671f7c0cfb30dc19b77fe09d98cce560a1b70e69560",
      "english": "Hey, you...\fGwah!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000107E4",
      "source_words_sha256": "cef11b5158cb355839ec8c322a5d9c84e6c57315ab372d00d08986744209c435",
      "english": "No, no! I quit\nthe Joui rebels!\nI'm just unemployed now...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010898",
      "source_words_sha256": "ba3dddd47bd9e3dadcc045bf4072546027aa79c28a8eee6a58654b5feb44b2fe",
      "english": "Gin Tama battles. Got it?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000108B8",
      "source_words_sha256": "10ba43d2a4bedc2fa4744e8a0d3188ffa474ddaf5ce88a7994175db445d9c919",
      "english": "I don't have\na Dragon Tama either...\fBut I just saw one...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0001090C",
      "source_words_sha256": "5376c0752be56b3f555a54fc84fb69e1d2e6417240ce3a281c3ac94253143f1d",
      "english": "Beat me in a\nGin Tama battle\nand I'll tell you. Deal?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010988",
      "source_words_sha256": "1e5dcef80e96e90ae0fe727f1eb3f36aa1de8580b7f1c6d484bc1d9bca8c4208",
      "english": "Right here...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010A6C",
      "source_words_sha256": "1993e426c6f265af2ffbb2793e68932a2a7fcb4ff5b44a8e04a29de976134703",
      "english": "Not that much...\nHe ran off the way\nyou came from, though...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010AC0",
      "source_words_sha256": "7f928dca3e74345e31838b522401836ce6c5774e2f5be8f9fb21d7536e68779c",
      "english": "I tried to battle\na silver-haired guy\nwith dead fish eyes...\fHe had too few orbs,\nso I turned him down.\nHe'll be back with more.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010B78",
      "source_words_sha256": "5bd696be7e12e3a70ede2be91407eae34186501fbc1c4cd2ea9a98e38a5a65de",
      "english": "The Dragon Tama guy\nran off the way\nyou came from...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010BB8",
      "source_words_sha256": "73cfb6e72615d8705043155fa04226d8578dbdd0d46b0e3047127ebb831ae2ef",
      "english": "Damn... You and\nthat silver-haired guy...\nWhy are you so strong?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010C40",
      "source_words_sha256": "5d834b5419379d34e217892b3dcf3e454d0cc189690d14d98962052057da262f",
      "english": "Where did he go next?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010C68",
      "source_words_sha256": "29da2eafe65e7db2c3e20d28f1ed9456b21188809751b3adf926d25d67208a09",
      "english": "...\fSorry. I'm busy\nlooking for someone.\nCan this wait?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010D6C",
      "source_words_sha256": "c7029c90a96e72884468558fb778db9fb626f9a88c4631882fc4a779002acffb",
      "english": "Gin! Here of all places!\nIt must be fate!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010DFC",
      "source_words_sha256": "6938f5cb866bfbd0335cae8f24eefbbdd1914c84d91eca2a3e578584526e5011",
      "english": "Ah! Now I see...\fOh...\nGorilla destiny...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010E3C",
      "source_words_sha256": "cb51ba5d1a9c66cf2a6248fef62479dce479d87c475708abb8bd260e27f29435",
      "english": "What?! Who are you?!\nPosing as Gin to approach me?\nI'm not that easy!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010EE0",
      "source_words_sha256": "5cc1c36ecaae257b899e978c9a42dea8892a86981815ea3133f56347e84ed834",
      "english": "Who's Gin?!\nDon't mistake me\nfor THAT bastard!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010F2C",
      "source_words_sha256": "301fddb502fd297bdf7ace4bfb4aa66c4f02775bbc9e65baab4a1d0a3432c18d",
      "english": "You know her, Kondo?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010F48",
      "source_words_sha256": "00c35d1cb32d524be0ef06167339018ac253b87cb3dce399df846d57ea24820c",
      "english": "Sougo... Stay calm.\nFind an interpreter.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010FB4",
      "source_words_sha256": "94662fc60d7f72ed14c250a3eeacded420245301898cf8c5e0aeca70f480dc2f",
      "english": "Yeah. An old friend\nof the old man...\nPut your glasses on!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00010FFC",
      "source_words_sha256": "5ebb0fb273622f129585e6525cb23b3d43701c380abba67dcc6a0a5b669ad14c",
      "english": "Look, Kondo!\nThe latest model!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00011020",
      "source_words_sha256": "c92aac30128bfb8ee6c4ea5a4f52d3c8d79178bc713e7fa3ab502591b8e329dc",
      "english": "A kappa?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00011034",
      "source_words_sha256": "737f31932118f3daaacacf03bc881a5e76bfd1cf10f91390808de0af82d30851",
      "english": "Suspicious guy...\nWhat are you doing here?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00011068",
      "source_words_sha256": "e69df6202da7974af5ba08d4d486754124a3362ca8ce59fbe590bb2e4a4f6e07",
      "english": "Kondo... After all that,\nwhy do you believe him?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00011094",
      "source_words_sha256": "8a15755fe1257ae77bf1418e0f60d1c3ba1443de1c092bd7017e54af1f91b7c8",
      "english": "Fine. For Kondo's sake,\nI'll let you off today.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000110D4",
      "source_words_sha256": "b23a1b52c98aecceff0ec2f620e788ba8c4a1d035f83941f28e993dd6d261456",
      "english": "Don't cause trouble...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000110FC",
      "source_words_sha256": "23d049717af15d93f4eebba5bf435fc7f0b2b36c552ab95c3fdb65e8b3590090",
      "english": "Practice? Diligent.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0001111C",
      "source_words_sha256": "a4e4d4f20271100089ba0b452923d609bc2507eaf8c667a5d715562419157139",
      "english": "He's got a golf club\nand said practice swings.\nWhat else could it be?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0001126C",
      "source_words_sha256": "4f28eca9d8f44b414671fba8f0bc2d4efae953509f497ad4b0bb06067a163831",
      "english": "Huh? Uh... You know...\nHahaha...\nPractice swings...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000112B8",
      "source_words_sha256": "534413581e1ea5e73a57d86706897477f5b52d0443ff506e631f5bc09c7ea892",
      "english": "...Yes.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0001132C",
      "source_words_sha256": "2bf6759a6968b94f86d2fd236a92ada5f3cb0005dfce07649ffd7f3f26cd1a91",
      "english": "Huh? An Inui?\nWhat are you doing here?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00011358",
      "source_words_sha256": "b079d5f7af8cad9dea65c19a95f9eef373148ec0bfe762e166daaef77d2186bc",
      "english": "Amanto or not,\nwe can talk, can't we?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0001138C",
      "source_words_sha256": "9e66ccfbd18df255d4ccda289fb448cae81010014ddc11fae483d99a807e00b3",
      "english": "The Inui are warriors.\nWhat's one of you\ndoing here?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000113D0",
      "source_words_sha256": "829a395dbebb44e8c604531b5ba8ceccd3c1dc8cb2bd6d8e92e3ab8d53411876",
      "english": "I see...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000113E4",
      "source_words_sha256": "83273945627b051b10a24033c5545c714fa931db6f1d3dc819ec1c8e52aca5e9",
      "english": "Idiot! I told you\nnot to mess with the Inui!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00011414",
      "source_words_sha256": "ef7db75b66c7a7b7a592bd799d8e2e213a29b7ef8dc6dfa49962b475df4aac09",
      "english": "I told you!\fThe Inui were the first\nAmanto here! Their greeting\nwas a cannon barrage!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_0001147C",
      "source_words_sha256": "5b40c2f32603cf92df8b7010feda787ed136df01bda9ef5fac16edd564e063dd",
      "english": "What's that about warriors?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_00011620",
      "source_words_sha256": "775142c2e2d15501b95d11c57baefdf3667ab9e463898b787b0e12c80cc9bdd9",
      "english": "It really is popular...",
      "translator_note": null
    }
  ]
}
